&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Position&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Software Engineer (React Native / React ) to join our Sportsbook engineering team. You&#39;ll be working on foundational engineering, focusing on improving the underlying frameworks, tooling, and performance that enable FanDuel to deliver an exciting and innovative customer experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working with our React Native Sportsbook application, you&#39;ll contribute to app performance improvements and help enhance our core codebase to improve quality, scalability, and developer experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for engineers who are collaborative, curious, and committed to developing their skills. The ideal candidate has practical experience with React Native and an interest in mobile performance, tooling, and best practices. Exposure to native Android or iOS development is a plus. As a member of this team, you will contribute to the foundations of our mobile platform, helping FanDuel engineers deliver features more effectively while maintaining platform quality and engineering best practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a growth company, so there are plenty of opportunities for you to learn &amp;amp; grow with us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Some of your responsibilities will include:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contributing to the core React Native codebase that underpins our Sportsbook application&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working on app launch performance and broader performance improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building and maintaining frameworks, tooling, and shared components to support feature teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborating with engineers across domains to solve cross-cutting technical challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implementing pragmatic solutions that balance performance, maintainability, and scalability&lt;/li&gt;
